stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE

  IDLE --> WAITING_HUMAN: new_game (human first)\nor after AI move
  IDLE --> COMPUTING_AI: new_game (AI first)

  WAITING_HUMAN --> DETECTING_MOVE: human_move_detected\nor human_ready
  DETECTING_MOVE --> WAITING_HUMAN: inference failed
  DETECTING_MOVE --> PENDING_ILLEGAL: illegal / ambiguous
  DETECTING_MOVE --> COMPUTING_AI: legal human move

  PENDING_ILLEGAL --> GAME_OVER: confirm game over
  PENDING_ILLEGAL --> COMPUTING_AI: override → continue

  COMPUTING_AI --> EXECUTING_MOVE: ExecuteMove dispatched
  COMPUTING_AI --> GAME_OVER: terminal position
  COMPUTING_AI --> WAITING_HUMAN: sim / no robot turn

  EXECUTING_MOVE --> WAITING_HUMAN: move complete or verify fail handled
  EXECUTING_MOVE --> COMPUTING_AI: AI vs AI next side
  EXECUTING_MOVE --> IDLE: estop

  WAITING_HUMAN --> GAME_OVER: checkmate / draw / limit
  GAME_OVER --> IDLE: reset

  note right of DETECTING_MOVE
    Human inference in game_manager
    not in behaviour tree
  end note

  note right of PENDING_ILLEGAL
    VALIDATING_MOVE exists in enum
    but is unused in current code
  end note
